WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.588 --> 00:00:04.672
When we get this
up and running,

00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:05.632
we gonna be outta here.

00:00:05.632 --> 00:00:07.717
Stanford, Morehouse,
Spelman.

00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:12.828
This is something
Einstein

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:14.307
spent his entire life
trying to do.

00:00:14.307 --> 00:00:15.308
We prove that

00:00:15.308 --> 00:00:17.060
time travel into
the past is possible,

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:19.020
if we just give
it some time.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.857
You scare me,
but you inspire me.

00:00:21.857 --> 00:00:23.023
You going places, CJ.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.150
Since Pops is gone,

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.027
I got to make sure
that you get there.

00:00:26.277 --> 00:00:28.070
I don’t need you always
playing big brother.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.697
I’m the only big
brother you’ve got.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.702
NYPD – don’t move!

00:00:37.122 --> 00:00:39.373
Calvin Walker – a
19-year-old, black teen

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:40.875
was allegedly
shot and killed

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:42.793
by an NYPD officer.

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:45.338
Walker was armed with
nothing but a cellphone.

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:48.592
I am so sorry
about all of this.

00:00:48.592 --> 00:00:50.635
If I could go back
and fix it, I would.

00:00:58.727 --> 00:01:00.645
If we just go back,
get them out of there,

00:01:00.645 --> 00:01:01.603
then he’s saved.

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:03.230
We only have so many
times to get this right.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.815
Everything’s going to
need to be perfect.

00:01:06.818 --> 00:01:07.693
What’s today’s date?

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:09.028
June 28th.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.405
Woohoohoo!

00:01:13.992 --> 00:01:15.285
Sebastian, this
has to work.

00:01:15.827 --> 00:01:16.535
No!

00:01:16.577 --> 00:01:17.537
We’re too late.

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:19.372
It’s about controlling
something we obviously

00:01:19.372 --> 00:01:20.332
have no control over!

00:01:20.332 --> 00:01:22.125
My brother didn’t
deserve this.

00:01:22.125 --> 00:01:23.167
I just miss him, yo.

00:01:23.835 --> 00:01:25.170
How many times have
you jumped back, CJ?

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:27.047
We’re not superheroes.

00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:31.802
Where is the justice?

00:01:31.802 --> 00:01:33.010
We can’t do
this anymore.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:34.803
We only have
two jumps left.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:39.517
Where is the justice
for our sons

00:01:39.517 --> 00:01:40.768
and our daughters.

00:01:45.315 --> 00:01:48.067
When will it end
for the whole nation?

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:49.193
You gotta listen to us,

00:01:49.193 --> 00:01:50.612
you’re going to
get killed.

00:01:50.612 --> 00:01:51.847
Get on the ground!

00:01:51.848 --> 00:01:53.907
On the ground, now!
Get down!

